  IconPath: icons/commodities/treasure/statuette-gargoyle-green-gold.webp
  Description: "Demons debase all they touch. One of your ancestors fell victim to
    their corruption, and you're burdened by that sin. Tradition divine Bloodline
    Skills Intimidation, Religion Sorcerous Gifts cantrip: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Caustic
    Blast]; 1st: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Fear]; 2nd: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Enlarge];
    3rd: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Slow]; 4th: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Divine
    Wrath]; 5th: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Blister]; 6th: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Disintegrate];
    7th: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Divine Decree]; 8th: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Canticle
    of Everlasting Grief]; 9th: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Implosion]
    Bloodline Spells initial: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Glutton's Jaws];
    advanced: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Swamp of Sloth]; greater: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Chthonian
    Wrath] Blood Magic\u2014Corruption of Sin You mentally broadcast brief glimpses
    into the darkest desires of the mind. Either a target takes a \u20131 status
    penalty to AC for 1 round, or you gain a +2 status bonus to Intimidation checks
    for 1 round. @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feat-effects.Item.Effect: Demonic Blood Magic]"
